OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,6,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,7,Fsome sunny intervals. Chance of a
OL,8,Flight shower along the Argyll coast.
OL,9,
OL,10,CTonight:FMainly dry this evening, one
OL,11,For two showers along the Argyll coast.
OL,12,FThen staying mainly dry overnight but
OL,13,Fstill with a few showers along the
OL,14,Fwest coast.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FRain will spread east in the
OL,17,Fmorning. Drier weather with a few
OL,18,Fshowers spreading from the west in the
OL,19,Fafternoon. Fresh southerly winds in
OL,20,Fthe morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
