OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry with
OL,6,Fsunny spells on Friday, a few showers
OL,7,Fat first across Argyll. Windy with
OL,8,Frain spreading east on Saturday. Drier
OL,9,Fwith just a few showers on Sunday.
